--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c9876f83510731f4d97169c0d46b0606, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue on hell
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: Very nice! Seriously, well done, my little exorcist.
    portugueseLine: Muito bom! Muito bom mesmo meu pequeno exorcista.
    chineseLine: "\u592A\u68D2\u4E86!  \u771F\u7684\u975E\u5E38\u68D2\uFF0C\u6211\u7684\u5C0F\u9A71\u9B54\u4EBA\u3002"
    spanishLine: "\xA1Muy bien! \xA1De verdad, lo hiciste excelente, mi peque\xF1o
      exorcista!"
  - participant: 0
    englishLine: "Alright, bro, now you\u2019re gonna chill here, right?"
    portugueseLine: "Ta, mano, agora voc\xEA vai ficar de boa aqui n\xE9? "
    chineseLine: "\u597D\u4E86\uFF0C\u5144\u5F1F\uFF0C\u4F60\u73B0\u5728\u53EF\u4EE5\u5728\u8FD9\u513F\u5B89\u5B9A\u4E0B\u6765\u4E86\u5427?  "
    spanishLine: "Bueno, hermano, ahora s\xED te vas a quedar tranquilo ac\xE1, \xBFno?"
  - participant: 0
    englishLine: "We already took down Gael. Your throne vanished, but you\u2019ll
      find it again soon."
    portugueseLine: "Ja matamos o Gael. Teu trono sumiu, mas daqui a pouco voc\xEA
      acha ele."
    chineseLine: "\u6211\u4EEC\u5DF2\u7ECF\u5E72\u6389\u76D6\u5C14\u4E86\u3002\u4F60\u7684\u738B\u5EA7\u867D\u7136\u6D88\u5931\u4E86\uFF0C\u4F46\u4F60\u5F88\u5FEB\u5C31\u4F1A\u627E\u5230\u5B83\u3002"
    spanishLine: "Ya matamos a Gael. Tu trono desapareci\xF3, pero pronto lo vas
      a encontrar."
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: "Sadly... I\u2019m afraid I still need your help."
    portugueseLine: Infelizmente... receio que ainda precise de sua ajuda
    chineseLine: "\u53EF\u60DC......\u6211\u6050\u6015\u8FD8\u662F\u9700\u8981\u4F60\u7684\u5E2E\u5FD9\u3002"
    spanishLine: "Lamentablemente... me temo que todav\xEDa necesito tu ayuda."
  - participant: 0
    englishLine: "Dude, we had a deal. Take out the horned guy and you\u2019d leave."
    portugueseLine: "Cara, a gente tinha um acordo. Era matar o chifrudo e voc\xEA
      ia embora."
    chineseLine: "\u54E5\u4EEC\uFF0C\u6211\u4EEC\u53EF\u662F\u6709\u7EA6\u5B9A\u7684\u3002\u5E72\u6389\u90A3\u4E2A\u957F\u89D2\u7684\u5BB6\u4F19\uFF0C\u4F60\u5C31\u8D70\u4EBA\u3002"
    spanishLine: "Oye, ten\xEDamos un trato. Era matar al cornudo y t\xFA te ibas."
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: "So... You didn\u2019t actually finish him off"
    portugueseLine: "Ent\xE3o... Voc\xEA n\xE3o matou ele ainda kk"
    chineseLine: "\u6240\u4EE5......\u4F60\u8FD8\u6CA1\u5F7B\u5E95\u5E72\u6389\u4ED6\uFF0C\u54C8\u54C8"
    spanishLine: "Entonces... No lo mataste a\xFAn jaja"
  - participant: 0
    englishLine: But we just blasted him to pieces right now...
    portugueseLine: Mas acabamos de pipocar todinho ele aqui, agorinha. Bicho foi
      de arrasta pra cima
    chineseLine: "\u53EF\u6211\u4EEC\u521A\u521A\u4E0D\u662F\u628A\u4ED6\u6253\u7206\u4E86\u5417...
      ..."
    spanishLine: Pero lo reventamos todo hace un ratito...
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: "He\u2019s an angel! His spirit just went back to Heaven."
    portugueseLine: "Ele \xE9 um anjo! O esp\xEDrito dele s\xF3 voltou pro c\xE9u."
    chineseLine: "\u4ED6\u662F\u4E2A\u5929\u4F7F!  \u4ED6\u7684\u7075\u9B42\u53EA\u662F\u56DE\u5230\u5929\u5802\u4E86\u3002"
    spanishLine: "\xA1Es un \xE1ngel! Su esp\xEDritu solo regres\xF3 al cielo."
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: "You\u2019ve got to finish him up there."
    portugueseLine: "Precisa matar ele l\xE1 no c\xE9u"
    chineseLine: "\u4F60\u5F97\u53BB\u5929\u5802\u518D\u628A\u4ED6\u6740\u6389\u3002"
    spanishLine: "Tienes que matarlo all\xE1 arriba, en el cielo."
  - participant: 0
    englishLine: WHAT? YOU go!
    portugueseLine: "O QUE? VAI VOC\xCA"
    chineseLine: "\u4EC0\u4E48!  ?  \u4F60\u81EA\u5DF1\u53BB! "
    spanishLine: "\xBF\xA1QU\xC9!? \xA1Ve t\xFA!"
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: I got kicked out, remember?
    portugueseLine: 'Eu fui expulso, lembra? '
    chineseLine: "\u6211\u88AB\u8D76\u51FA\u6765\u4E86\uFF0C\u8BB0\u5F97\u5417\uFF1F"
    spanishLine: "\xA1Me echaron de all\xE1, \xBFrecuerdas?!"
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: "Now go! That portal will drop you right near Heaven\u2019s gate."
    portugueseLine: "Agora v\xE1! Pegue esse portal que vai sair bem perto da entrada
      do c\xE9u"
    chineseLine: "\u73B0\u5728\u53BB\u5427!  \u7A7F\u8FC7\u8FD9\u4E2A\u4F20\u9001\u95E8\uFF0C\u5B83\u4F1A\u628A\u4F60\u4F20\u5230\u5929\u5802\u5165\u53E3\u9644\u8FD1\u3002"
    spanishLine: "\xA1Ahora ve! Ese portal te llevar\xE1 justo cerca de la entrada
      al cielo."
